# StrucTiSM: estimate a documented basic structural model on the airline data.
# Plots are made from the package's returned component series, not by a public plot API.
open bjg.gdt --quiet
bundle mod = STSM_setup(lg, 1, 1, 2, 2)
STSM_estimate(&mod)
list comps = STSM_components(mod)
# Plot each returned state series in an independent pane.
scatters comps --time-series --output=display
